        "content": "## Candidate Handoff Demo\n\n**Setup**\n1. Run airtable_setup.py and paste the Base ID into the **Config** node\n2. Pick your Airtable credential on the 5 Airtable HTTP nodes\n3. Pick your Slack credential + channel ID on the 2 Slack nodes\n4. Activate, then POST {\"candidate_code\":\"CAND-001\",\"job_code\":\"JOB-1001\",\"recruiter\":\"you\"} to /webhook/submit-candidate\n\n**Demo story:** CAND-001 passes; CAND-002/003/005/006/007 each get blocked for a different reason; CAND-004 passes with a warning.\n\nThis flow verifies EVIDENCE of checks held in the CRM. It does not run right-to-work, ID or background checks itself.",
